# SHA-256 checksums for the anomalyco/opencode (formerly sst/opencode) CLI
# release assets that scripts/download-opencode.sh downloads, pinned to
# OPENCODE_VERSION in that script. Format matches `shasum -a 256 -c`:
# "<sha256>  <asset-name>".
#
# The version must match the @opencode-ai/sdk version the sidecar drives
# (apps/sidecar, pnpm-lock.yaml): SDK 1.18.30 <-> CLI v1.18.30. The previous
# pin (opencode-ai/opencode v0.0.55) was the archived Go CLI, a different
# program that does not implement the server API the SDK speaks.
#
# PROVENANCE: first taken from the GitHub release API's per-asset `digest`
# field (W03a, 2026-10-25). Re-verified 2026-10-25 (release slice) for all
# four assets with `scripts/download-opencode.sh --all --verify-only
# --cross-check-npm`: downloaded bytes == pin == upstream digest; GitHub-signed
# immutable-release attestation verified (`gh release verify-asset`); and the
# binary inside each archive is byte-identical to the one in upstream's npm
# package `opencode-<os>-<arch>@1.18.30` (tarball checked against the npm
# registry's sha512 integrity). download-opencode.sh re-checks the pin, the
# upstream digest and (when gh is available; always in release.yml) the
# attestation on every run.
#
# REGENERATE when bumping the version (and @opencode-ai/sdk together):
#   VERSION=vX.Y.Z
#   gh api repos/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tags/$VERSION \
#     --jq '.assets[] | select(.name | test("^opencode-(darwin-(arm64|x64)\\.zip|linux-(x64|arm64)\\.tar\\.gz)$")) | "\(.digest | ltrimstr("sha256:"))  \(.name)"'
#   # update the "# Version:" line below, then confirm independently:
#   scripts/download-opencode.sh --all --verify-only --cross-check-npm
#
# Version: v1.18.30
a5e43d6887386efc7d68ce49ae28e3bbdfdee3dfd1d7169b612c3ce67e53b1e8  opencode-darwin-arm64.zip
7453007e58ff122401438d95ccb24334874b5908dcaee77883f96c23395d5710  opencode-darwin-x64.zip
55007246858165496ff85ba1c2b648f7421e8e2013bf4189a680c9ff8e699d17  opencode-linux-x64.tar.gz
4111a55c2a02c0fac314bd51e9a2330280e6d29d2b85b9554fff6d62612566ed  opencode-linux-arm64.tar.gz
